            <note corresp="#d661-f1" n="17" type="source" xml:id="d661-f1-content">
                <p>The substance of this instruction was sent, on April 25, to the American
                    representative at the capital of each of the countries that lodged
                    representations against H. R. 8874 and H. R. 8875 and identic S. 3501 and S.
                    3502.</p>
            </note>
